# Delete Important Scheduled Task | T1489 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_schtasks_delete.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\schtasks.exe" OR OriginalFileName="schtasks.exe") (CommandLine="*-delete*" OR CommandLine="*/delete*" OR CommandLine="*–delete*" OR CommandLine="*—delete*" OR CommandLine="*―delete*") (CommandLine IN ("*\\Windows\\BitLocker*", "*\\Windows\\ExploitGuard*", "*\\Windows\\SystemRestore\\SR*", "*\\Windows\\UpdateOrchestrator\\*", "*\\Windows\\Windows Defender\\*", "*\\Windows\\WindowsBackup\\*", "*\\Windows\\WindowsUpdate\\*"))
